<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - WMC sees flat to higher 96/97 output.</title>
<headline>RTRS - WMC sees flat to higher 96/97 output.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold and nickel miner WMC Ltd on Thursday forecast flat to slightly higher production of its key commodities over the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
